OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes through railings and
OL,4,Ahits school building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has hit a school gym after
OL,7,Fcrashing through nearby railings.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,10,Fsaid the incident happened at Limehurst
OL,11,FAcademy in Loughborough shortly after
OL,12,F18:00 BST on Monday.
OL,14,FThe service said two crews, which
OL,15,Fattended the scene to make the vehicle
OL,16,Fsafe, found no-one was trapped or
OL,17,Finjured.
OL,19,FLeicestershire Police confirmed no-one
OL,20,Fwas arrested following the crash.
